title: Authorizations › New case › Referral › The full referral page
route: /authorizations/new/referral/RF-2053?draft=draft-1001
intro: One referral in full: the header, the one decision banner, the source document on the left and five tabs on the right. It is a page inside New case, so 'Back to the case' and the breadcrumb lead back to the case.
dir: TD
---
start s1 "Click 'Open the full referral'\non the referral checklist"
start s2 "Click 'View' on the 'Referral or admission order' row\non the Medical records step"
start s3 "Open an old link such as /referrals/RF-2053\n(no case in the address)"

process p1 "Address is /authorizations/new/referral/RF-2053?draft=…\nThe case id rides along so the page can lead back to it\nWithout it, a draft that already holds this referral is used"
decision d1 "Is that referral in the demo?"
screen sc0 "Crumbs 'New case › Referral › RF-9999'\n'That referral is not in the demo'\n'Referral RF-9999 does not exist. Go back to the referral step to drop the documents or pick one that arrived.'"
click cBack "Click 'Back to the referral step'"
goto gStart "Continues in: New case › Referral › Start screen"

store st1 "Referral is marked opened\nSidebar badge on 'New case' drops"
screen sc1 "Referral page\nCrumbs 'New case › Referral › RF-2053' and, at the right, the button 'Back to the case'\nStepper: 'Referral' is current, nothing in it is clickable"
screen sH "Header card\nPill '{Program} requested', big RF number, status pill, urgency pill\nPatient · source · channel · received · payer\nSmall stepper Received, Reviewed, Decided, Admitted"
process pSla "Red pill 'Past response target' while New or In review\nafter 1 hour (emergent), 4 hours (urgent) or 24 hours (routine)"
goto gHead "Continues in: New case › Referral › Header actions"
goto gBan "Continues in: New case › Referral › Decision banners"
screen sBan "One banner under the header\nThe most important one: declined, accepted, coverage lapsed, waiting on the referrer, or Reader found N things to check"

group gCr "Breadcrumb"
  click cC1 "Click the crumb 'New case'"
  click cC2 "Click the crumb 'Referral'"
  decision dC "Is there a case?"
  decision dD "Is there a case?"
  process pC1 "Opens that case (its current step)"
  process pC2 "Opens the checklist for this referral: ?ref=RF-2053"
  process pC3 "Opens New case with no case id\nA new blank case starts"
  process pC4 "'RF-2053' is plain text, not a link"
endgroup
group gBk "Back to the case"
  click cBk "Click 'Back to the case'\n(beside the crumbs)"
  decision dBk "Is there a case?\n(?draft= in the address, or a draft that holds this referral)"
  process pBk1 "Opens that case (its current step)"
  process pBk2 "Opens New case with no case id\nA new blank case starts"
endgroup
goto gOv "Continues in: New case › How a case starts and resumes"
goto gChk "Continues in: New case › Referral › Referral checklist"

group gTwo "Two columns"
  screen sDoc "Left: 'Source document' card (stays in view while you scroll)\n'Fax from {referrer}, Mon 2:10 pm'\n'Referral form' and 'Face sheet', print, page buttons"
  screen sTab "Right: tabs\nExtracted · Validation (with the count of open findings) · Coverage · Fit · Activity"
endgroup
click cT1 "Click 'Extracted' (the tab it opens on)"
click cT2 "Click 'Validation'"
click cT3 "Click 'Coverage'"
click cT4 "Click 'Fit'"
click cT5 "Click 'Activity'"
goto gT1 "Continues in: New case › Referral › Full page: Extracted tab and document"
goto gT2 "Continues in: New case › Referral › Full page: Validation tab"
goto gT3 "Continues in: New case › Referral › Check coverage"
goto gT4 "Continues in: New case › Referral › Full page: Fit, Activity and notes"

s1 --> p1
s2 --> p1
s3 --> p1
p1 --> d1
d1 -->|No| sc0 --> cBack --> gStart
d1 -->|Yes| st1 --> sc1 --> sH --> pSla
sH --> gHead
sc1 --> sBan --> gBan
sc1 --> cC1 --> dC
sc1 --> cBk --> dBk
dBk -->|Yes| pBk1 --> gOv
dBk -->|No| pBk2 --> gOv
sc1 --> cC2 --> dD
dC -->|Yes| pC1 --> gOv
dC -->|No| pC3 --> gOv
dD -->|Yes| pC2 --> gChk
dD -->|No| pC3
sc1 -.-> pC4
sc1 --> sDoc
sc1 --> sTab
sTab --> cT1 --> gT1
sTab --> cT2 --> gT2
sTab --> cT3 --> gT3
sTab --> cT4 --> gT4
sTab --> cT5 --> gT4
sDoc -.-> gT1
